<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trailer Bridge started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trailer Bridge started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said on Monday it started coverage of truck and marine freight carrier Trailer Bridge Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 5/8 to 11-3/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
